      "info": {
        "name": "Seat-order voting",
        "ability": "Nominations are public and may target living or dead players. Living players and dead players with Last Breaths remaining may vote; each player receives 1 Last Breath for the whole game. The Storyteller records visible approvals clockwise, starting after the nominee. The highest total must reach half the living players; a tie or missed threshold spares everyone."
      },
